@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    .privacy-page .privacy-content {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .privacy-page h1 {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #0d6efd;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .privacy-page h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2c2c2c;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .privacy-page h2:first-of-type {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .privacy-page h3 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #444;
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .privacy-page p {
        margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
    }
    .privacy-page ul {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
    .privacy-page ul li {
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .privacy-page a {
        color: #0d6efd;
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    .privacy-page a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .privacy-page .address-block {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
        border-left: 4px solid #0d6efd;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .privacy-page .address-block a {
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    .privacy-page section {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .privacy-page .highlight-box {
        background: #e7f1ff;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #0a58ca;
    }
</style>

<div class="container py-4 privacy-page">
    <div class="privacy-content">
        <h1>Turf Producers Association Privacy Policy</h1>

        <section>
            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
            <p>Turf Producers Association (“TPA,” “we,” “our,” or “us”) is an organization dedicated to supporting high-quality sod growers and promoting the growth of RTF Sod and HGT Sod. We are located at:</p>
            <div class="address-block">
                <strong>Turf Producers Association</strong><br />
                2617 Tepee Circle<br />
                Fremont, Nebraska 68025<br />
                United States<br />
                Phone: 402.480.4936<br />
                Email: <a href="mailto:jenny@turfrproducers.com">jenny@turfrproducers.com</a>
            </div>
            <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect personal information submitted through our website, including <a href="https://turfproducers.com/contact-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://turfproducers.com/contact-us</a> and other related pages (collectively, the “Site”).</p>
            <p>By using our Site, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

            <h3>1. Information You Provide to Us</h3>
            <p>When you use our Contact Us form or otherwise communicate with us, we may collect:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Name</li>
                <li>Email address</li>
                <li>Information you provide in message fields</li>
                <li>Information about where you heard about us</li>
            </ul>
            <p>If you contact us by phone or email, we may collect any information you voluntarily provide during that communication.</p>
            <p>If you download membership applications (HGT or RTF), we may collect information you provide in connection with membership inquiries or applications.</p>

            <h3>2. Automatically Collected Information</h3>
            <p>When you visit our Site, certain information may be collected automatically, such as:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>IP address</li>
                <li>Browser type</li>
                <li>Device information</li>
                <li>Pages visited</li>
                <li>Date and time of visit</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This information helps us maintain website functionality and improve user experience.</p>

            <h3>3. reCAPTCHA</h3>
            <p>Our Site is protected by Google reCAPTCHA. The use of reCAPTCHA is subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google’s Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Terms of Service</a>. reCAPTCHA may collect hardware and software information (such as device and application data) and send that data to Google for analysis to prevent spam and abuse.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We may use the information we collect to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Respond to your inquiries</li>
                <li>Provide information about growing RTF Sod or HGT Sod</li>
                <li>Process membership interest or application requests</li>
                <li>Communicate with potential and existing sod growers</li>
                <li>Improve our Site and services</li>
                <li>Protect against spam, fraud, or misuse</li>
                <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="highlight-box">We do not sell your personal information.</div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How We Share Information</h2>
            <p>We may share personal information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>With service providers who help operate our Site (such as website hosting or spam protection services)</li>
                <li>When required by law or legal process</li>
                <li>To protect our rights, property, or safety</li>
                <li>With your consent</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="highlight-box">We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.</div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
            <p>Our Site may use basic cookies or similar technologies to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Maintain website functionality</li>
                <li>Improve performance</li>
                <li>Enhance user experience</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You may configure your browser to refuse cookies; however, some features of the Site may not function properly as a result.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Data Security</h2>
            <p>We take reasonable steps to protect the personal information you provide from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.</p>
            <p>However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Links to Other Websites</h2>
            <p>Our Site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any site you visit.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
            <p>Our Site is not directed to children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
            <p>Your continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of those changes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact:</p>
            <div class="address-block">
                <strong>Turf Producers Association</strong><br />
                2617 Tepee Circle<br />
                Fremont, Nebraska 68025<br />
                United States<br />
                Phone: 402.480.4936<br />
                Email: <a href="mailto:jenny@turfrproducers.com">jenny@turfrproducers.com</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
